This is certainly a bug. This works with every pet in theory. The only
condition that must hold is that your pet carrys some gold. Every time it
drops an item it also drops the gold. But this is not implemented well.
After it drops the gold it still has the gold (check this with a stethoscope).
In practice this will only work with greedy monsters (or more difficult,
monsters that can swallow you). You can throw gold to the monster before or
after you tamed it. In debugmode it succeeded with $10000 a time.

I shall report this bug!

